{"in_scope":true,"answer_markdown":"I can't show you what is waiting for a Compliance Decision. The Approvals lookup returned "not found or not permitted for your role". That means either your role can't see those items or there are none to show. I can't tell which, and I won't guess at what is hidden.

The Queue on your screen doesn't list Recommendations or their Decision steps, so it can't answer this either. Decisions are recorded on the Approvals panel, not through the Assistant.

If you hold a role that decides Compliance steps, open the Approvals panel directly. Otherwise, ask a Compliance Officer or your administrator to check your access.","claims":[],"follow_up_questions":["Which Portfolios are past their review due date in the Queue?","Why is C003 ranked first in the Queue?","Which Portfolios have an SLA breach?"]}
